South America: Offshore projects, particularly in Brazil, provide opportunities for integrated drilling, well construction, and subsea-related services. Project economics and infrastructure requirements influence investment decisions.
Middle East & Africa: Mature-field redevelopment, production optimization, and large-scale oil and gas projects support demand for integrated services. National oil companies are important customers as they seek to strengthen domestic production capabilities and improve operational efficiency.

